<p>A furious fire storm rages around the caster, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">105, 142, 170, 194, 215</acronym> fire damage in a radius of 3 each turn for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">11, 12, 12, 13, 13</acronym> turns.</p><p>You closely control the firestorm, preventing it from harming your party members.</p><p>The damage and duration will increase with your Spellpower.</p>